n展望未来，英伟达的AI红利能否持续取决于竞争格局、技术迭代以及政策与市场环境，尤其是出口管制和国际政策风险可能对未来收入造成影响。未来AI风口不仅在算力，还包括软件开发工具、行业应用场景及边缘计算生态。\n\n![](https://sf3-ttcdn-tos.pstatp.com/img/tos-cn-i-tjoges91tu/73138f8761975238cc2b2c79ef14f5ec~cs.jpeg)\n来源:金融时报客户端\n记者:莫莉\n编辑:郑澜新\n邮箱:fnweb@126.com\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：英伟达 最新消息 2026年5月\n\n网页标题：News Archive | NVIDIA Newsroom\n\n网页链接：https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-a\n\n发布时间：2026-05-21T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：News Archive\n\n![](https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/media/themes/64d081263d633229694ae3db/images/NVIDIA-logo-BL.jpg)\nMay 21, 2026\nNVIDIA Announces Upcoming Events for Financial Community\nNVIDIA will present at the following events for the financial community: TD Cowen 54th Annual Technology, Media, \u0026 Telecom Conference Thursday, May 28, at 7:15 a.m. PT BofA Global Technology ...\n\n![](https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/219/files/202605/277f558f36eced978d8a8ed77de95cbd/6a0f2c2f3d6332cfde6440a7_computex-rolling-blog-kickoff-842x450/computex-rolling-blog-kickoff-842x450_mid.jpg)\nMay 21, 2026\nNVIDIA GTC Taipei at COMPUTEX: Live Updates on What’s Next in AI\nAt NVIDIA GTC Taipei at COMPUTEX, the world’s developers, researchers and industry leaders are converging to dive into the latest breakthroughs shaping every industry, covering topics spanning AI factories and scaling infrastructure to agentic and ...\n\n![](https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/219/files/202605/f95a7813324f1ce1bf5c88c4fbfd53e5/6a0f01f33d633200d41043df_gfn-thursday-5-14-nv-blog-1280x680-logo-1-842x450/gfn-thursday-5-14-nv-blog-1280x680-logo-1-842x450_mid.jpg)\nMay 21, 2026\nLicense to Stream: ‘007 First Light’ Coming to GeForce NOW With an Ultimate Bundle\nThe mission begins now. GeForce NOW is dialing up the action with a blockbuster mix of spy thrills, high-speed racing and member rewards — plus eight new games joining the cloud this week, all ready to stream instantly. Leading the drop: the 007 ...\n\n![](https://iprsoftwaremedia.com/219/files/20224/6296531eb3aed3741918b6b5_DH1L4415-HDR